    "chunk_text": ", and lufode \u00deone macodan \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan him to m\u00e6ran gode, and \u00e6t wega gel\u00e6tum him lac offrodan, and to \u00d0es god w\u00e6s arwyr\u00f0e betwyx eallum h\u00e6\u00feenum, and he is o\u00f0on gehaten o\u00f0rum naman on denisc. Nu secga\u00f0 \u00fea deniscan on heora gedwylde \u00fe\u00e6t se iouis w\u00e6re, \u00fee hi \u00feor hata\u00f0, mercuries sunu, \u00fee hi Sum wif hatte uenus, seo w\u00e6s ioues dohter, swa fracod on galnysse \u00fe\u00e6t hire f\u00e6der hi h\u00e6fde, and eac Manega o\u00fere godas w\u00e6ron mislice afundene, and eac swilce gydenan, on swi\u00f0licum wur\u00f0mynte Se syrwienda deofol, \u00fee swica\u00f0 embe mancyn, gebrohte \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan on \u00fe\u00e6t healice gedwyld, \u00fe\u00e6t hi Hi gesettan eac \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6re sunnan and \u00feam monan, and \u00feam o\u00f0rum godum, \u00e6lcum his d\u00e6g: \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6re \u00deone feor\u00fean d\u00e6g hi sealdan, him to frofre, \u00feam fores\u00e6dan mercurie, heora m\u00e6ran gode. \u00deone fiftan d\u00e6g hi freolsodan m\u00e6rlice, ioue to wyr\u00f0mynte, \u00feam m\u00e6restan gode. \u00d0one sixtan d\u00e6g hi gesetton \u00fe\u00e6re sceamleasan gydenan uenus gehaten, and fricg on denisc. \u00deone seofo\u00f0an d\u00e6g hi sealdan saturne \u00feam ealdan, \u00fe\u00e6ra goda f\u00e6der, him sylfum to frofre, endenex\u00f0 Hi woldan git wur\u00f0ian arwur\u00f0licor \u00fea godas, and forgeafon him steorran, swilce hi ahton heora Ac \u00fea",
